Data licence

Except where noted, the data in the data/ directory is made available under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Some datasets are derived from upstream sources under their own attribution
licences. Each dataset's source, licence, and required credits are listed in
data/meta.json and are returned in every API response as `meta.source`.
When you reuse the data, credit "Desh API contributors" and the upstream
sources listed for the datasets you use.
